<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="description" content="The Flow SÃ©nÃ©gal - Nos partenaires institutionnels, associatifs et privÃ©s qui soutiennent la protection du fleuve SÃ©nÃ©gal Ã  Saint-Louis.">
  <title>The Flow SÃ©nÃ©gal | Partenaires - Ils nous soutiennent</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
